#!/bin/bash

# tam-pkg-install — pick packages from the Arch repositories in a fuzzy
# finder and install them (Menu → Install → Package).
#
#   tam-pkg-install
#
# Ported from Omarchy 4.0.4 (omarchy-pkg-install) for plan 18 R4.15h.
# Changed: the list leaves out the [omarchy] repository, which plan 18
# removes, and the choice installs through tam-pkg-add, which asks before
# taking a dependency from it (agent/docs/agent-guides/package-management.md).
# Packages already installed are left as they are, not reinstalled.
